# An allowlist: the build context is only what `npm ci`, `next build` and
# `npm run build:cli` read. Everything else stays out, secrets first: `.env`
# never enters, whatever new file appears next to it.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!src/
!public/
!scripts/
!db/

